Exact source of m1n1-aurora 1.6.1.aurora22.j714s2 built by
TripleU613/omarchy-mac-installer. Base: omacom/m1n1 02785a35e046 (not
AsahiLinux m1n1: kboot_n1.c only exists on the omacom base). The raw
installer patch is sha256 d634a7aba77b...

Carries the N1 host-tunable admission/copy the Wi-Fi kernel train needs
(after rolotrealanis98/m5pro-linux m1n1 patch0028), T6050 SMP bounds and
USB/PIPE safety.
